  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/5441be73edc6f3ca8f365a0082fe9474524cd62f.png\" alt=\"Setrion&#x27;s Fabulous Furniture (Header)\"></p>\n<p>你是否曾觉得游戏中需要更多的家具？\n现在，有了这个模组，这一愿望终于实现了！而且数量非常可观！</p>\n<p>本模组为游戏添加了超过 10000 种新的方块，未来还将有更多内容陆续推出！</p>\n<p>木工台的制作配方如下：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ce0b22c90ec2aefd3966760db6e5ee4ba26bbd45.png\" alt=\"Carpentry Table Recipe\"></p>\n<h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fYtdPKMVnqj\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;text-align:center\">点击这里！</span></a> 加入 Discord 服务器！</h3>\n<h2>示例家具</h2>\n<p><strong>厨房</strong>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/aab81c57788624b917306ef8e55a38292fe87614.png\" alt=\"Kitchen Example\"></p>\n<p><strong>卧室</strong>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Rma3TxeZ/images/43cb301a76bcfb64e9094e970e97a7fa624a77ab.png\" alt=\"Bedroom Example\"></p>\n<p><strong>户外</strong>\n<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/Rma3TxeZ/images/d70bc56ea0e6a3dbee310ac8bbdc26442c6818cb.png\" alt=\"Outdoor Example\"></p>\n<p>未来还将添加更多家具！</p>",
